            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_N202DB">
               <extent xml:id="extent_N202DC">4 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N202DF">35 x 29.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202E2">Written in brown ink. Paper: 20 staves. 12 bars only. The first seven bars are complete for two tenors and two basses with text; the following five bars tenors only without text. Hartmann has made room for four stanzas, but only written 1 and 2. The first stanza: "Lang er vor Sølvervinter, den korte Sommer er kun en Drøm i Mulmet, der gaaer og kommer. Men gjennem Snee og Taage, ved", is not in the final version. Inserted Tenore 1mo part written in black ink on blue staves. At the rim of the paper golden ornaments and figures.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
